          "answer": false,
          "explanation": "The ending moves to the particle: Gelecek misin?"
        },
        {
          "id": "3",
          "statement": "In “Ne zaman geleceksin?” you don't need mi.",
          "say": "Ne zaman geleceksin?",
          "answer": true,
          "explanation": "There's a question word, ne zaman — the question is already asked."
        },
        {
          "id": "4",
          "statement": "The negative -me goes after the suffix -ecek.",
          "answer": false,
          "explanation": "The other way round: -me goes right after the stem, before -ecek: gelmeyecek."
        }
      ]
